    {
      "name": "render_still",
      "description": "Use when you need a picture of one CS2 item at an exact float, pattern seed, stickers, charm, StatTrak count and name tag. Name the item with a Steam inspect link or with a catalog id from catalog_search. Returns the /api/still webp URL and an img tag. include_image: true also returns the picture; it needs INSPEKT_SECRET and counts as one render. Steam Market and inventory links (ending S...A...D... or M...A...D...) are refused; use id instead. For the live 3D viewer use embed_snippet. Example: {\"id\":\"ak47_cu_ak47_cobra_gen\",\"wear\":0.24,\"seed\":661,\"view\":\"front\",\"bg\":\"rarity\",\"width\":640,\"height\":400}",
